cline-build

The binaries published from this repository are compiled from
https://github.com/cline/cline, which is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A copy of that license is published with every release.

They are unofficial builds: no musl targets exist upstream at the time of
writing (cline/cline#15271), and the compilation is done here by applying
patches/opentui-musl-libc.patch to an upstream release tag. They are not
endorsed, supported or distributed by the Cline project.

The build scripts in this repository are provided under the same Apache-2.0
terms unless stated otherwise in a file.
